Start with the equation $A^x+B^y=C^z$. This experience follows the structural reductions rather than presenting the open conjecture as settled. For background, see [exponential Diophantine equations](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diophantine_equation), the [abc conjecture](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abc_conjecture), and [Fibonacci numbers](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fibonacci_sequence).

